#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "It is our pleasure to announce the availability of Quarkus 4.0.0.Beta1, the first Beta of the next major version of Quarkus."
msgstr "我们很高兴地宣布，Quarkus 4.0.0.Beta1 现已发布，这是 Quarkus 下一个主要版本的第一个测试版。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Quarkus 4 is a major new version and comes with a lot of changes.\n"
"The final release is planned for the end of November.\n"
"We need extension developers to migrate their extensions and end users to test their applications with it."
msgstr "Quarkus 4 是一个重大新版本，带来了许多变化。最终版本计划于 11 月底发布。我们需要扩展开发者迁移他们的扩展，并需要最终用户使用该版本测试他们的应用程序。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Your feedback at this stage is essential to make Quarkus 4 a great release, please report any issues you encounter on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub]."
msgstr "在这个阶段，您的反馈对于打造一个出色的 Quarkus 4 版本至关重要，请在 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] 上报告您遇到的任何问题。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus 4 comes with significant upgrades across the board, and more are coming:"
msgstr "Quarkus 4 在各方面都进行了重大升级，未来还将推出更多新功能："

#, fuzzy
msgid "Java 21"
msgstr "Java 21"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "New base Java version, making virtual threads more central."
msgstr "新的基础 Java 版本，使虚拟线程发挥更核心的作用。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Netty 4.2 and Vert.x 5.x"
msgstr "Netty 4.2 和 Vert.x 5.x"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "New foundation for the networking layer."
msgstr "网络层的新基础。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "QUIC support"
msgstr "对 QUIC 的支持"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "QUIC is becoming the new foundation of distributed systems: HTTP/3, MQTT over QUIC, WebTransport (WebSocket over QUIC)..."
msgstr "QUIC 正逐渐成为分布式系统的新基石：HTTP/3、基于 QUIC 的 MQTT、WebTransport（基于 QUIC 的 WebSocket）……​"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "HTTP/3"
msgstr "HTTP/3"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Opt-in support for HTTP/3 with automatic certificate generation in dev and test modes."
msgstr "在开发和测试模式下支持可选启用的 HTTP/3，并自动生成证书。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Native transports"
msgstr "原生传输方式"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Improve the concurrency of your application with epoll or io_uring support.\n"
"Also works in native executables."
msgstr "通过支持 epoll 或 io_uring 来提升应用程序的并发性。在原生可执行文件中同样适用。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Observation API"
msgstr "观察 API"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`@Observed` or programmatic API to generate metrics and traces.\n"
"Works with Micrometer and OpenTelemetry."
msgstr "`@基于观察或` 程序化的 API，用于生成指标和追踪。支持 Micrometer 和 OpenTelemetry。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Dev UI Observability dashboard"
msgstr "开发人员 UI 可观测性仪表盘"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Built-in Observability section in the Dev UI, available out of the box in dev mode with no wiring needed."
msgstr "开发界面中的“内置可观测性”部分，在开发模式下开箱即用，无需任何配置。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Jakarta REST 4"
msgstr "雅加达 REST 4"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "JSON Merge Patch, new multipart API."
msgstr "JSON Merge Patch，新的多部分 API。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hibernate ORM 8"
msgstr "Hibernate ORM 8"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Integration of the new major version of Hibernate with Jakarta Persistence 4.0 and Jakarta Data 1.1."
msgstr "将 Hibernate 的新主要版本与 Jakarta Persistence 4.0 和 Jakarta Data 1.1 进行集成。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Jackson 3"
msgstr "杰克逊 3"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "New major version - everything has changed except for the annotations."
msgstr "新主要版本——除了注释之外，其他一切都发生了变化。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "CDI 5.0"
msgstr "CDI 5.0"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "New annotations such as `@Reserve` and `@Eager`."
msgstr "新的注解，例如 `@Reserve` 和 `@Eager` 。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "New JMS extension"
msgstr "新的 JMS 扩展"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Dedicated JMS extension with compatibility with Spring JMS, pooled JMS, and IronJacamar."
msgstr "专用的 JMS 扩展，兼容 Spring JMS、池化 JMS 和 IronJacamar。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "@ExactlyOnce"
msgstr "@ExactlyOnce"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Improved Kafka transaction support."
msgstr "改进了对 Kafka 事务的支持。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Upgrading to Quarkus 4"
msgstr "升级到 Quarkus 4"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Migration guide"
msgstr "迁移指南"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We wrote a https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-4.0[migration guide].\n"
"As expected for a new major version, it is more dense than for our usual minors."
msgstr "我们编写了一份 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-4.0[迁移指南] 。正如新主要版本通常的情况一样，这份指南的内容比我们平时的小版本更新更为详尽。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "For extension developers"
msgstr "致扩展开发者"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you are maintaining a Quarkus extension, now is the time to start migrating it to Quarkus 4.\n"
"The https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-4.0[migration guide] contains all the information you need."
msgstr "如果您正在维护一个 Quarkus 扩展，现在正是将其迁移到 Quarkus 4 的好时机。 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-4.0[迁移指南中] 包含了您所需的所有信息。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Please reach out to us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] if you have any questions or need help with the migration."
msgstr "如果您有任何疑问或在迁移过程中需要帮助，请通过 link:https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] 联系我们。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "快来加入我们吧"

#, fuzzy
msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "我们非常重视您的反馈，因此请随时报告 bug、提出改进建议……​让我们一起打造出精彩的作品吧！"

#, fuzzy
msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "无论您是 Quarkus 用户，还是单纯出于好奇，都请不要害羞，欢迎加入我们这个热情友好的社区："

#, fuzzy
msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "在 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] 上提供反馈；"

#, fuzzy
msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "编写一些代码并 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[提交一个 PR] ；"

#, fuzzy
msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "请在 link:https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[和邮件列表] 上与我们讨论；"

#, fuzzy
msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "请在 link:https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] 上提问。"
